{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tangled Crisis</i> is built around a deceptively simple goal\u00a0<strong>escape the maze</strong>. But with <strong>limited visibility</strong>, a <strong>ticking timer</strong>, and <strong>multiple Screens</strong>, you challenged to <strong>act fast</strong>, <strong>think ahead</strong>, and <strong>memorize</strong> optimal <strong>paths</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanics\u00a0</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Boost -&gt;</strong> Hit the turbo! Blaze through obstacles with a burst of speed and full-on invincibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.poster.avif?t=1760714256\" width=800 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.webm?t=1760714256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/4e1ad532f12a4180a152f25d6b712476.mp4?t=1760714256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc40 <strong>Vision -&gt;</strong>\u00a0Widen your vision and slow down time to expose sneaky shortcuts or give you those extra seconds to react!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.poster.avif?t=1760714256\" width=800 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/a9821edec2e34f4adf638ed1d3ad74f0.webm?t=1760714256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=