ng> Explore multi-screen challenges through portals, there is more than meets the eye!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.poster.avif?t=1760714256\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.webm?t=1760714256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519440/extras/d3bdb64144910a0846a2e32b0f264bf4.mp4?t=1760714256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Diamond Hunt</strong> -&gt; Grab all the fruits in a level to make a diamond pop! Use it to unlock skips and replay your favorite days anytime!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong> <br><i>Tangled Crisis</i> offers two different game modes to keep you challenged and entertained, whether you\u2019re a casual player or a hardcore maze master:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Classic Modes:</strong> Play three distinct modes (<strong>Casual</strong>, <strong>Normal</strong>, <strong>Challenge</strong>). Perfect if you love <strong>structured gameplay</strong> and want to master different maze layouts and puzzles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Arcade:</strong> If you seek a\u00a0<strong>nonstop test of skill</strong>, the endless run mode delivers <strong>fast-paced</strong>, <strong>high-intensity</strong> ga